      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "Thank you for the request!\n\nAre you familiar with `IsInstanceOwner()`? It allows you to detect Group and Public instances, though it doesn't allow you to distinguish between them.\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/worlds/udon/networking/network-components/#networking-properties\n\nWould this fulfill your feature request, or are you looking for something else?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
