      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would like to see this too, exposing more stuff to Udon just seems like a good idea.\n\nI get asked this a lot about Audience Anarchy and Murder. I like to make sure the Public and Group Public experience of those games are accessible to the average random person visiting public vrchat worlds, but there are some advanced features that I only want to enable when it's a closed group/invite only instance, which make sense for players who can moderate themselves and know each other better. Also vice versa; sometimes you want a world to have more moderation-related/safeguard features in public instances, but optional in private worlds.\n\nSee also https://feedback.vrchat.com/udon/p/give-udon-u-access-to-instance-information-group-information",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
